module proof_planning
lineage L_A
lineage L_B
agent A lineage L_A
agent B lineage L_B
grant A effect externalAct uses 1 until 100
observe route by B content "route-three-blocked" confidence 0.95
communicate route from B to A as route_at_A
endorse route_at_A by A threshold 0.90
authorize route_at_A by A for planning
proof p_access access route_at_A by A
proof p_origin origin route_at_A source B lineage L_B
proof p_clear clear route_at_A for A
proof p_end endorsement route_at_A by A
proof p_auth authorization route_at_A by A for planning
proof p_use use route_at_A by A for planning from ["p_access","p_origin","p_clear","p_end","p_auth"]
plan reroute by A using route_at_A effect externalAct expected 1.0 requires p_use
execute reroute by A
feedback reroute by A observed 1.1
assert proof p_use valid true
assert action reroute executed true
